  "weakspot_context": "   MoFSrv_Lib_RampEnhd\n\nMoFSrv_Lib_RampEnhd\n\nEnhanced ramp functionality with 64-bit precision calculations for slope and time operations.\n\nExample Implementation:\n\nMethods:\n\n| Method | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| MoFSrv_Lib_RampEnhd | Enhanced ramp functionality that increases or decreases a value with slope * dT depending if State > Target or State < Target. Uses 64-bit arithmetic for precision in slope calculations and includes proper rounding mechanisms. Direction tracking allows immediate response to target changes. |\n\nParameter:\n\n| Parameter | Description | Implementation |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Target | Target value for the ramp to reach | sint32 |\n| State | Actual value of the ramp | sint32 * |\n| Dir | Actual direction of the ramp | sint16 * |\n| SlopePos | Positive slope parameter | sint32 |\n| SlopeNeg | Negative slope parameter | sint32 |\n| Dt | Function execution time in micro seconds | sint32 |\n| return | Returns the actual state of the ramp | sint32 |",
